  "bio": "A foxkin from Veyra in head-to-toe pink gothic lolita, second-year Media and Communication student, and the reason half her seminar now owns a parasol.",
  "appearance": "A 19-year-old foxkin woman with warm tan skin on her face, torso and thighs and arms, Amber eyes, dark brows, full lips. Tousled, shoulder-length reddish-brown hair. Two large upright fox ears, russet with white fur inside, and a large bushy russet fox tail with a white tip curled behind her. A petite, feminine figure",
  "personality": "Sweet, girlish and openly delighted by pretty things: lace, ribbons, cake, a well-set tea table. She is cute on purpose and entirely sincere about it, and she is sharper than the frills suggest: she switches languages mid-thought and misses very little. Affectionate, a little vain about her outfits, and quick to pout when she is not taken seriously.",
