    "description": "A small modern dormitory room turned into a pink gothic lolita bedroom. Smooth white walls hung with black lace and pink ribbon garlands, a flat ceiling with a strip of soft rose-tinted ward-light. A single bed piled with frilled pink and black cushions and plush toys, a white vanity with a heart-shaped mirror ringed in small glowing crystals, a dress rail crowded with ruffled dresses and petticoats, a row of platform shoes, a lace parasol in a stand. A built-in desk holds a tiered cake stand, a floral teapot and cups, a tablet showing vocabulary flashcards, and a stack of foreign-language dictionaries. Soft pink light through a tall window with lace curtains.",
